<title>CANADA: TENNIS-CANADIAN OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CANADIAN OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $2.3 million</p>
<p>Canadian Open men's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>6-Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat 1-Michael Chang (U.S.) 6-3</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Chris Woodruff (U.S.) beat 4-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) 5-7</p>
<p>7-5 6-3</p>
</text>
